WEBVTT

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:09.960
Black Star and Golden Bat.

00:00:59.310 --> 00:00:59.870
Thank you Aerospace.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:03.760
that today the project of the Rocket TN has been presented,

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:06.930
original project of the prestigious Professor Kim,

00:01:07.090 --> 00:01:09.630
very famous specialist in this type of robots.

00:01:09.980 --> 00:01:12.660
Professor Kim has announced that this new robot

00:01:12.660 --> 00:01:14.660
will bring great benefits to humanity.

00:01:30.640 --> 00:01:56.130
Is it the Aerospace Science Center?

00:01:56.450 --> 00:01:59.620
Tonight I will go to the moon to take over the plans of the rocket...

00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:01.480
Defend yourselves well!

00:02:02.360 --> 00:02:03.480
Who am I?

00:02:04.420 --> 00:02:06.850
I am Blackstar! Blackstar!

00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:21.640
Blackstar said he would come now.

00:02:21.880 --> 00:02:24.760
But it will be impossible for him to break our defenses even if Blackstar is a ghost.

00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:26.580
If he appears, we will kill him without a doubt.

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:29.020
Blackstar! Blackstar!

00:02:31.020 --> 00:02:34.860
Urgent news. Pay close attention, please, pay close attention.

00:02:35.080 --> 00:02:40.160
Just as Black Star had announced, he showed up in the Aerospace Science Center

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:42.550
and stole the planes of the TNM rocket.

00:02:42.550 --> 00:02:47.360
Despite the numerous controls and positions of surveillance, it seems that Black Star has managed to escape.

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:59.220
... of this criminal, the collaboration of the population is requested.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:03.200
If anyone sees him, please inform the police immediately.

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:07.320
Be careful, we are living a moment of real danger.

00:03:09.050 --> 00:03:21.140
Stop crying, or else I'll call Black Star.

00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:23.640
Black Star!

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:31.210
No, no, no.

00:04:00.660 --> 00:04:27.040
It's a great day for all of us.

00:04:27.340 --> 00:04:29.960
The plans of RocketDNM are...

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:36.930
in our hands with them we can conquer the whole world and we will form the kingdom of black star

00:04:36.930 --> 00:04:46.350
black star is invincible really what luck we have he advises us to protect the planes well

00:04:46.350 --> 00:04:55.830
because it is possible that golden bat will come to attack us do not worry golden bat will never be

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:58.430
He was as crazy as to try to attack us!

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:06.110
It is true. Our guard is well protected by the high tension barrier and no one will dare to attack us.

00:05:07.260 --> 00:05:11.940
Besides, there is the powerful bigot capable of facing any enemy.

00:05:12.600 --> 00:05:17.960
Then, Chin-Chin, for the future kingdom of Black Star, let's toast!

00:05:18.320 --> 00:05:18.780
Let's toast!

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:27.080
Who are you?

00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:29.760
Let me see you and don't laugh!

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:32.380
Come here if you are a man!

00:05:32.860 --> 00:05:33.940
I'm coming!

00:05:43.880 --> 00:05:45.040
It's Goldenback!

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:51.040
How did he discover our hideout? Damn it!

00:05:53.400 --> 00:05:54.320
Take him!

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:01.400
Come on, guys, come on!

00:06:01.400 --> 00:06:03.560
Come on, guys, quick!

00:06:07.080 --> 00:06:09.660
Come on, guys, quick, quick!

00:06:16.900 --> 00:06:18.040
Hard with him!

00:06:21.820 --> 00:06:25.240
Cover him before he escapes!

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:29.980
Thank you.

00:07:55.380 --> 00:07:56.180
IDIOTS!

00:07:56.270 --> 00:07:58.430
GREAT SOL GAFALEN!

00:07:58.550 --> 00:07:59.050
LET'S GO!

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:00.820
Arriba!

00:08:01.630 --> 00:08:02.170
Ay!

00:08:02.550 --> 00:08:03.630
He's so sleepy!

00:08:04.310 --> 00:08:05.750
Why don't you wake us up?

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:10.460
You were snoring!

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:12.720
Great!

00:08:14.460 --> 00:08:16.640
You think we're on the beach, don't you?

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:17.360
What idiots!

00:08:17.740 --> 00:08:17.840
Look!

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:19.570
You're naked!

00:08:20.170 --> 00:08:21.990
Golden Bat has made fun of you!

00:08:23.130 --> 00:08:25.030
Are you okay with a mustache?

00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:28.980
How is that possible?

00:08:30.410 --> 00:08:33.390
What a shame! What a shame! What a shame!

00:08:33.710 --> 00:08:36.830
Mr. Bigotón, do you have the Golden Bat's mark on your butt?

00:08:37.710 --> 00:08:41.610
And a part of your beautiful mustache has disappeared!

00:08:43.230 --> 00:08:46.870
What? The Golden Bat's mark on my mustache?

00:08:47.190 --> 00:08:50.090
This is too much! I'll get rid of Golden Bat!

00:08:50.270 --> 00:08:51.990
I'll get rid of him! I'll get rid of him!

00:09:12.310 --> 00:09:23.490
Oh, Blackstam, my lord, we have been attacked by Goldenbat. Next time, my revenge will not escape. I will make you pay for your audacity. I insist on it in my word.

00:09:27.030 --> 00:09:29.950
Idiot! It is useless that you fight with me.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:38.060
against Golden Bat. He has always defeated us, but this time I will end him with my own hands!

00:09:38.480 --> 00:09:44.030
I will show him what my strength is and he will never dare to cross my path again!

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:45.350
Never again!

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:55.400
You will pay for this, Golden Bat! You will pay for this!

00:10:00.920 --> 00:10:05.680
Hey, Toltry is determined to continue playing the war with the other boys and to break the glass of the houses.

00:10:05.880 --> 00:10:07.400
I think you should tell him something.

00:10:08.340 --> 00:10:11.220
Ah, I also did the same.

00:10:11.580 --> 00:10:11.820
Eh?

00:10:12.390 --> 00:10:16.250
Yes, do not put that face. I played the same things when I was little.

00:10:16.690 --> 00:10:19.540
You must understand it and not protest so much.

00:10:19.660 --> 00:10:22.960
It is convenient to remember from time to time that we have been children.

00:10:24.420 --> 00:10:27.420
How is your illness, Honey, Toltry's friend?

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:29.590
They say it's getting worse.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:31.860
Poor thing, all alone in the world.

00:10:32.260 --> 00:10:32.900
I'm sorry.

00:10:35.690 --> 00:10:36.590
Does the Toltri sleep?

00:10:36.950 --> 00:10:38.230
I think so.

00:10:38.430 --> 00:10:40.110
Although that is never known.

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:45.110
What is that noise?

00:10:45.800 --> 00:10:46.620
Maybe it's a thief.

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:48.180
Come on, go and see.

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:56.980
It was a cat, don't worry.

00:10:57.540 --> 00:10:58.580
Oh, it was the cat.

00:11:30.060 --> 00:11:33.660
What a strange cat. In my life I had heard howls like that.

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:37.710
Hello, forgive me if I have imitated you.

00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:39.330
What I do well is to put face to race.

00:12:25.530 --> 00:12:26.430
I'll show you a trick you don't know.

00:12:57.320 --> 00:12:59.150
Soldiers, retreat!

00:13:24.600 --> 00:13:29.800
I'm invincible, I'm brave and strong, I'm not afraid of anything.

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:34.920
I have no fear, nothing scares me, I can do anything!

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:39.190
I don't know why he laughs so much!

00:13:39.330 --> 00:13:41.490
The poor thing is full of fright!

00:14:14.810 --> 00:14:16.710
Now you'll see!

00:14:17.730 --> 00:14:20.620
I was scared of my own shadow.

00:15:01.140 --> 00:15:02.680
Chicho! Answer!

00:15:04.690 --> 00:15:05.750
Chicho! Answer!

00:15:10.080 --> 00:15:11.300
Chicho! Where are you?

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:13.280
Chicho!

00:15:17.260 --> 00:15:18.840
What's up, Fido? Why are you crying?

00:15:19.430 --> 00:15:22.090
You're also scared, aren't you?

00:15:22.090 --> 00:15:23.060
Don't worry.

00:15:23.770 --> 00:15:25.800
Calm down. Calm down, kid. I'm here.

00:15:28.020 --> 00:15:29.760
We've been through a lot of danger.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:31.480
and nothing serious has ever happened to us.

00:15:31.620 --> 00:15:34.460
Our motto is to live the adventure and do good.

00:15:37.710 --> 00:15:43.800
Where are you going? Have you found something?

00:15:46.390 --> 00:15:57.760
What's going on? Why are you barking?

00:16:04.760 --> 00:16:05.160
Chicho!

00:16:07.080 --> 00:16:12.180
Wake up, Chicho! What are you doing?

00:16:12.400 --> 00:16:13.560
Chicho, it's me, Toltri!

00:16:30.380 --> 00:16:37.270
Ah! A ghost! A ghost!

00:16:37.610 --> 00:16:40.270
No, it's me, Totri. Calm down, man.

00:16:40.610 --> 00:16:42.890
Oh, I thought it was a ghost.

00:16:43.310 --> 00:16:44.130
Oh, how scary.

00:16:44.330 --> 00:16:44.830
A ghost?

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:46.230
Yes, a ghost.

00:16:46.430 --> 00:16:47.650
A ghost.

00:16:48.010 --> 00:16:50.950
Yes, a moment ago a ghost appeared behind that tree.

00:16:51.130 --> 00:16:51.990
Really? Don't tell me.

00:16:54.170 --> 00:16:56.350
Fido, if you had seen it, you would be terrified.

00:17:04.700 --> 00:17:06.180
But there's no one here.

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:29.530
Well, I've seen it with all my heart.

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:33.050
I'm so scared! Let's go now, please!

00:17:33.950 --> 00:17:37.460
A long time ago I heard that there were ghosts around here.

00:17:38.380 --> 00:17:40.420
Let's go home. My parents are waiting for us.

00:18:01.660 --> 00:18:01.860
Thank you.

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:41.290
How are you?

00:18:41.310 --> 00:18:41.810
Hi, Javi.

00:18:41.850 --> 00:18:42.150
Hi, Javi.

00:18:43.080 --> 00:18:43.720
You look better.

00:18:44.480 --> 00:18:45.220
Yes, it's true.

00:18:45.360 --> 00:18:45.900
You look good.

00:18:47.620 --> 00:18:48.460
Stay in bed.

00:18:48.700 --> 00:18:49.200
Don't get tired.

00:18:49.650 --> 00:18:50.230
I'm fine.

00:18:51.070 --> 00:18:53.370
Juni's dad has been very nice and has helped me a lot.

00:18:56.450 --> 00:18:57.910
Chicho has helped you a lot.

00:18:58.860 --> 00:18:59.740
Thank you very much.

00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:02.520
We want you to recover very soon.

00:19:02.860 --> 00:19:05.470
And so we can play the war.

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:09.540
Without you we always lose. We miss you a lot. Be good.

00:19:10.180 --> 00:19:12.500
I've seen Goldenbat in my dreams.

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:15.230
Do you like Goldenbat so much?

00:19:17.060 --> 00:19:19.260
Do you really think Goldenbat exists?

00:19:19.300 --> 00:19:20.850
Of course I do.

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:21.450
Of course.

00:19:21.910 --> 00:19:25.800
Well then I would like to see him a lot.

00:19:26.180 --> 00:19:28.780
I'm sure I'll feel good right away.

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:30.780
Right away.

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:46.960
My dream is to become a Golden Bat to defeat the evil and help the poor.

00:19:47.200 --> 00:19:48.890
I would like to be an authentic Golden Bat.

00:19:49.550 --> 00:19:50.930
Not like the one in cartoons.

00:19:51.670 --> 00:19:53.690
Who knows if I will be able to meet him.

00:19:56.080 --> 00:19:58.540
One day Golden Bat will come to visit you.

00:19:58.600 --> 00:19:59.900
Because he loves the...

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:00.660
Guys like us.

00:20:01.180 --> 00:20:02.640
Of course.

00:20:03.060 --> 00:20:03.780
Yes, man.

00:20:04.320 --> 00:20:07.880
By the way, when are you going to explore the ghost cave?

00:20:08.180 --> 00:20:09.300
We will go tomorrow.

00:20:09.680 --> 00:20:13.320
We would have liked to go with you. We will think a lot about you.

00:20:13.580 --> 00:20:14.200
Good luck.

00:20:15.160 --> 00:20:18.100
Don't worry, I'll tell you later in great detail.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:45.950
What do you think?

00:20:46.250 --> 00:20:59.790
It's been a show for you, I'm sure you'll like it.

00:21:00.090 --> 00:21:01.470
Attention, raise your heels!

00:21:01.920 --> 00:21:04.880
Ladies and gentlemen, I present to you, to begin with,

00:21:04.940 --> 00:21:07.760
Tolltree, the best imitator in the world!

00:21:09.830 --> 00:21:10.570
Let's see...

00:21:14.050 --> 00:21:16.550
To begin with, I will imitate the cocking of a hen.

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:57.930
I'm a wolf, I'm a fierce wolf, I'm a tigress, I'm a guinea pig, I will imitate for you the song of a bird.

00:22:04.350 --> 00:22:05.730
Ha, ha, ha, ha!

00:22:06.530 --> 00:22:13.850
You like it, don't you, honey?

00:22:14.290 --> 00:22:14.590
Yes.

00:22:15.070 --> 00:22:17.440
Ha, ha, ha, ha!

00:22:18.420 --> 00:22:22.450
To finish, our great artist will imitate a m-

00:22:43.530 --> 00:22:47.590
And then I introduce you to the famous singer Yoni.

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:01.140
Is it a flower bouquet?

00:23:02.160 --> 00:23:06.040
It's a flower bouquet, grandma.

00:23:07.420 --> 00:23:27.720
Yes, mama.

00:23:34.000 --> 00:23:37.480
If I die, who will take care of my poor little one?

00:23:37.620 --> 00:23:39.600
I can't close my eyes.

00:23:39.760 --> 00:23:42.000
I can't leave you alone, my son.

00:23:42.720 --> 00:23:44.040
Don't die, mom.

00:23:44.300 --> 00:23:45.540
Don't die, please.

00:23:47.620 --> 00:23:48.960
Don't cry, Honey.

00:23:49.300 --> 00:23:50.000
Don't cry.

00:23:50.400 --> 00:23:52.240
Even if I'm not with you,

00:23:52.420 --> 00:23:54.020
you'll have to keep growing

00:23:54.020 --> 00:23:56.860
to become a good man.

00:23:57.360 --> 00:23:58.920
Understood, Honey?

00:24:01.370 --> 00:24:01.930
Mother!

00:24:02.940 --> 00:24:04.060
Mother!

00:24:12.560 --> 00:24:13.680
Mother!

00:24:14.210 --> 00:24:14.630
Mother!

00:24:19.240 --> 00:24:20.360
Mother!

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:30.320
The newspaper!

00:24:31.010 --> 00:24:47.930
Are you cold, Honey?

00:24:48.170 --> 00:24:51.490
Get warm.

00:24:51.890 --> 00:24:52.770
Will you sit well?

00:24:53.050 --> 00:24:54.460
Thank you.

00:25:00.000 --> 00:25:00.600
Thank you very much.

00:25:00.880 --> 00:25:02.220
This too.

00:25:02.600 --> 00:25:03.760
What is it?

00:25:04.700 --> 00:25:05.280
Some gloves.

00:25:05.720 --> 00:25:06.760
I made them myself.

00:25:06.920 --> 00:25:07.940
They are for you.

00:25:08.240 --> 00:25:11.850
Thank you.

00:25:12.050 --> 00:25:15.720
See you at school.

00:25:16.160 --> 00:25:18.230
Yes, there we will see each other.

00:25:22.630 --> 00:25:23.110
Prensa!

00:25:23.390 --> 00:25:23.850
Hello.

00:25:26.380 --> 00:25:27.660
What are you doing here?

00:25:28.020 --> 00:25:29.660
Well, we were just looking for you.

00:25:30.060 --> 00:25:32.700
You know that Chicho gets fatter every day, right?

00:25:33.040 --> 00:25:34.100
Well, look...

00:25:34.570 --> 00:25:38.050
I get a little fat at the right time.

00:25:38.170 --> 00:25:41.170
We thought that this jacket of yours would fit you perfectly.

00:25:42.000 --> 00:25:44.340
Give me the newspapers.

00:25:44.780 --> 00:25:46.870
What are you doing? I have to distribute them.

00:25:47.010 --> 00:25:48.370
We'll do it ourselves.

00:25:48.610 --> 00:25:49.930
That way we'll have fun.

00:25:50.150 --> 00:25:50.530
See you later.

00:26:00.120 --> 00:26:29.210
You're sad because you're crying.

00:26:30.220 --> 00:26:30.880
Yes, why?

00:26:31.280 --> 00:26:36.300
What's wrong with you, Honey? Tell me.

00:26:36.520 --> 00:26:39.080
I'm very grateful for your friendship.

00:26:39.420 --> 00:26:42.000
It excites me how generous you are.

00:26:42.340 --> 00:26:46.980
It's giving importance, it's the best thing you can do.

00:26:46.980 --> 00:26:47.900
We are great friends.

00:26:48.560 --> 00:26:52.570
Well, I wish you good luck for tomorrow's adventure in the morning.

00:26:54.100 --> 00:26:54.680
Thank you.

00:26:55.020 --> 00:26:55.560
Good night.

00:26:55.940 --> 00:26:56.620
Have a good rest.

00:26:58.450 --> 00:26:59.250
Good luck again.

00:27:00.000 --> 00:27:04.880
Tell me everything, don't worry, we will discover the mystery of the cave.

00:28:07.550 --> 00:28:12.800
You're still a coward, you're scary, it seems like a lie.

00:28:16.430 --> 00:28:21.130
I thought there was a ghost, and you all know that I'm allergic to ghosts.

00:28:22.090 --> 00:28:25.130
Coward, don't complain, let's go.

00:28:31.240 --> 00:28:40.400
The sky is getting dark, I don't like those clouds.

00:28:40.420 --> 00:28:41.520
Do you think it will rain?

00:28:41.820 --> 00:28:44.230
Yes, it will rain for sure.

00:28:44.670 --> 00:28:46.130
We will have to take refuge.

00:28:57.750 --> 00:28:59.650
I don't have a son!

00:29:00.000 --> 00:29:01.240
It's so hot in here!

00:29:07.460 --> 00:29:10.340
Get up! It's starting to rain!

00:29:10.660 --> 00:29:14.040
Let's go, Chicho!

00:29:15.890 --> 00:29:17.870
I'm going! I'm going!

00:29:37.770 --> 00:29:45.400
I've never seen such a quiet house.

00:29:47.190 --> 00:29:49.030
Let's go in to hide from the rain.

00:29:49.980 --> 00:29:52.770
No! I'm sure there will be a ghost.

00:29:53.430 --> 00:29:58.800
Don't be afraid, I'm here.

00:30:05.000 --> 00:30:08.280
Come on, Chichón! We're not going to be here all day!

00:30:08.620 --> 00:30:09.460
We'll get drunk!

00:30:15.080 --> 00:30:16.660
Don't get away from me!

00:30:31.500 --> 00:30:41.810
Altri, let's go back home. I can't stand the attention without poison.

00:30:41.810 --> 00:30:43.470
Don't worry, there's only skeletons.

00:30:43.770 --> 00:30:50.010
Oh, for mercy's sake, I beg you to let's go home soon. I'm scared, oh, very scared.

00:30:50.680 --> 00:30:56.790
Yes, I'm also very scared.

00:30:57.250 --> 00:30:59.760
We have to show our courage.

00:31:00.060 --> 00:31:05.420
Honey, the poor thing is so sick, what would he think if he knew that we have been running, what a shame!

00:31:07.040 --> 00:31:10.310
Wh-wh-who?

00:31:51.880 --> 00:31:54.870
You have awakened. What right do you have?

00:31:54.870 --> 00:31:59.400
Are you a man or a ghost? Answer me!

00:32:00.030 --> 00:32:05.740
Do not trust our appearance. We are very dangerous. Who are you?

00:32:06.280 --> 00:32:11.450
I am the lord of this mansion. Where do you think you are going?

00:32:11.510 --> 00:32:13.490
Let's go to the cave of the ghosts.

00:32:14.170 --> 00:32:16.730
Aha! Do not be afraid.

00:32:17.550 --> 00:32:21.120
I dare you to face the unknown.

00:32:22.000 --> 00:32:24.340
The cave is very far from here.

00:32:24.860 --> 00:32:26.540
No one can enter here.

00:32:26.960 --> 00:32:29.780
These skeletons are from those who tried to enter.

00:32:30.250 --> 00:32:34.480
Let's go home. I don't want to stay like them.

00:32:34.780 --> 00:32:36.420
Yes, it would be better to go home.

00:32:36.880 --> 00:32:39.960
Go home before it's too late.

00:32:41.350 --> 00:32:43.250
Get out, guys!

00:32:47.750 --> 00:32:49.210
Mom, help!

00:32:49.790 --> 00:32:53.510
Don't come back here if you don't want to die, okay?

00:32:54.230 --> 00:32:55.330
Don't come back!

00:33:07.130 --> 00:33:10.290
I'm here, where the ghost saw me.

00:33:26.640 --> 00:33:29.140
You stepped on my tail, you animal!

00:33:30.380 --> 00:33:30.980
What an animal!

00:33:32.760 --> 00:33:37.250
What is this?

00:33:37.690 --> 00:33:39.210
Come on, it's a doll.

00:33:40.050 --> 00:33:42.000
Have you seen? There is no ghost.

00:33:45.410 --> 00:33:48.490
Wait for me here. I'm going to see where those jokes come from.

00:33:48.530 --> 00:33:50.270
I think I have a pretty clear idea.

00:34:02.590 --> 00:34:08.600
There is a magnetophone connected to a very thin cable.

00:34:11.060 --> 00:34:11.980
Very ingenious.

00:34:12.190 --> 00:34:17.130
As soon as the cable is touched, the ghost's laughter sounds and the doll falls on top of you.

00:34:30.120 --> 00:34:33.700
They are the soldiers of Black Star.

00:34:33.860 --> 00:34:59.940
I think I saw them today.

00:35:00.000 --> 00:35:29.890
I have heard a strange noise, it seems to me that there is a tiger here

00:35:33.800 --> 00:35:35.600
Now I begin to understand.

00:35:37.000 --> 00:35:40.480
Actually, everything is very simple, guys.

00:35:41.100 --> 00:35:41.700
What?

00:35:43.100 --> 00:35:46.770
Let's continue. Surely we will find the ghost guard.

00:35:47.060 --> 00:35:47.740
Come with me.

00:35:48.640 --> 00:35:48.980
Okay.

00:36:06.840 --> 00:36:12.080
I'll tell you where the ghosts are. There is no doubt. We are going to enter.

00:36:12.700 --> 00:36:14.940
And if they catch us?

00:36:17.190 --> 00:36:20.150
Don't worry, it will be more exciting.

00:37:38.570 --> 00:37:39.770
But this is really wonderful.

00:37:40.270 --> 00:37:43.230
It is a tremendous base, I have not seen anything so great.

00:37:43.570 --> 00:37:47.470
It seems to be a base of aliens, of beings from other planets.

00:37:47.870 --> 00:37:49.670
Dad told me that Black Star

00:37:49.670 --> 00:37:52.570
tracks the unsignificant scientists of the whole world

00:37:52.570 --> 00:37:54.370
to conquer them.

00:38:00.120 --> 00:38:03.380
It's that man who was in the haunted house.

00:38:03.500 --> 00:38:05.060
Then I understand.

00:38:05.720 --> 00:38:09.140
They have set up the number of the ghosts so that no one approaches this base.

00:38:09.340 --> 00:38:11.380
It's an ingenious trick, but well known.

00:38:11.920 --> 00:38:14.620
Isaac, how do you catch them?

00:38:16.670 --> 00:38:18.290
Here comes the Supreme Leader!

00:38:18.470 --> 00:38:26.210
We listen to you, oh Black Star.

00:38:27.990 --> 00:38:29.970
Now we work to consti-

00:38:30.000 --> 00:38:34.700
the kingdom of Black Star that will understand the whole world.

00:38:35.160 --> 00:38:39.480
Our project to build it in the mountains of Soraka has failed

00:38:39.480 --> 00:38:42.140
because of the intervention of Golden Bat.

00:38:42.380 --> 00:38:46.600
But this place cannot be discovered by anyone.

00:38:47.160 --> 00:38:50.490
Not even Golden Bat will be able to discover it.

00:38:51.970 --> 00:38:56.910
Now we will have to manufacture the terrible TNM rocket

00:38:56.910 --> 00:38:59.250
that will allow us to overcome any resistance.

00:39:00.090 --> 00:39:06.490
For this reason, we have to go to Seoul and kidnap Professor Kim, who is the only one who can manufacture it.

00:39:06.650 --> 00:39:11.920
We have no choice but to do it. Nothing will be opposed to our projects. Nothing at all!

00:39:12.380 --> 00:39:19.120
Do you want to kidnap my father?

00:39:21.410 --> 00:39:22.830
We have to tell him immediately.

00:39:23.370 --> 00:39:26.070
Yes, that bandit will not get away with it.

00:39:27.610 --> 00:39:29.630
Let's run away from this base right away. Quickly!

00:39:32.840 --> 00:39:35.440
Invaders have entered our base. Stop them immediately!

00:39:35.800 --> 00:39:45.340
I don't know how, but they've found out about our presence. Let's run away!

00:40:03.220 --> 00:40:11.550
You were not afraid to come here.

00:40:12.430 --> 00:40:22.360
As I told you, you can not get out alive from this base.

00:40:22.540 --> 00:40:24.220
You have to die.

00:40:25.530 --> 00:40:26.450
I'm going to die!

00:40:31.630 --> 00:40:34.050
You have little life left.

00:40:42.220 --> 00:40:42.800
Hehehehe

00:40:42.800 --> 00:40:46.470
Yesterday there were two or three guys.

00:40:46.690 --> 00:40:50.700
One of them is the daughter of the famous scientist Professor Kim,

00:40:51.050 --> 00:40:58.430
expert that the police is carrying out active investigations to clarify the case.

00:40:59.410 --> 00:40:59.750
We wait.

00:41:00.160 --> 00:41:03.540
I will soon be able to offer you news about his release.

00:41:03.800 --> 00:41:13.870
Oh God, save my friends through Golden Bat.

00:41:14.030 --> 00:41:16.710
They have disappeared in the Ghost Cave.

00:41:16.890 --> 00:41:18.860
If you want, you can do it.

00:41:19.300 --> 00:41:22.220
Please, save my good friends soon.

00:41:22.400 --> 00:41:28.690
I could help them.

00:41:43.400 --> 00:41:45.840
We have achieved something very important without just work.

00:41:46.100 --> 00:41:48.960
Yes, how were we going to know that among the captured boys

00:41:48.960 --> 00:41:50.840
would be the daughter of Professor King?

00:41:51.060 --> 00:41:52.320
It has been a great luck.

00:41:52.780 --> 00:41:55.780
Now it will be easier for us to kidnap Professor King.

00:42:07.100 --> 00:42:09.410
Poor Pop, what will happen to him?

00:42:09.720 --> 00:42:15.300
Don't worry, the government will protect him because he is a very important person for our country.

00:42:15.520 --> 00:42:26.090
I hope they protect him well. We will die soon, but God, save my dad, please. I beg you, he is very good.

00:42:27.520 --> 00:42:29.960
Don't cry, you don't have to lose your courage, you have to...

00:42:30.820 --> 00:42:35.520
Now that I think about it, I haven't seen Afido for a while.

00:42:35.520 --> 00:42:37.760
He may have run away while we were being captured.

00:42:38.290 --> 00:42:41.800
I hope he's still alive. He's a smart dog. He'll know how to defend himself.

00:42:51.020 --> 00:42:53.980
Tell me, who am I talking to?

00:42:54.100 --> 00:42:56.760
How? My dear daughter, Junie?

00:42:57.350 --> 00:42:59.890
Listen to me carefully. If you...

00:43:00.030 --> 00:43:06.590
If he goes to the place I'm going to tell him, alone and without saying anything to anyone, he will be able to see her again, safe and sound.

00:43:06.870 --> 00:43:12.650
But if, on the contrary, he says something to the police, in that case, we will not answer for his life.

00:44:02.250 --> 00:44:06.470
You're going to save us! You're our hero!

00:44:07.400 --> 00:44:11.520
Well, you were having a bad time and I felt sorry for you.

00:44:11.540 --> 00:44:14.000
Let's run away! Let's go! Let's go!

00:44:15.810 --> 00:44:17.350
Thank you, Fido.

00:44:17.510 --> 00:44:20.410
You're welcome, boy. We're friends for this.

00:44:32.400 --> 00:44:32.620
Thank you.

00:45:47.720 --> 00:45:49.140
What's up, guys?

00:45:51.000 --> 00:45:57.580
Look up there!

00:46:00.350 --> 00:46:01.690
It's Golden Bat!

00:46:03.170 --> 00:46:06.220
It's Golden Bat! It's Golden Bat!

00:46:06.340 --> 00:46:07.760
It's Golden Bat! It's Golden Bat!

00:46:07.760 --> 00:46:08.280
It's Golden Bat!

00:46:10.300 --> 00:46:12.800
Don't you dare! Give him a house!

00:46:13.080 --> 00:46:15.420
Golden Bat was waiting for you!

00:46:15.560 --> 00:46:17.680
You took half of my moustache!

00:46:17.780 --> 00:46:18.840
I'll avenge myself!

00:46:30.350 --> 00:46:32.960
You are so evil, what a disappointment!

00:46:34.580 --> 00:46:38.360
I have defeated with my hands the invincible golden bat!

00:46:38.600 --> 00:46:40.230
So you can see how strong you are!

00:46:42.220 --> 00:46:52.780
But hey, if he's a kid!

00:46:56.050 --> 00:46:58.750
He's not the real golden bat!

00:46:59.210 --> 00:46:59.850
What do we do with him?

00:47:00.000 --> 00:47:00.580
With this guy.

00:47:00.920 --> 00:47:02.960
Spread out on the bench!

00:47:03.560 --> 00:47:04.020
Yes!

00:47:04.800 --> 00:47:05.140
No!

00:47:05.460 --> 00:47:06.420
No No!

00:47:08.610 --> 00:47:09.770
God help me, Honey!

00:47:10.190 --> 00:47:11.240
No, Honey!

00:47:12.460 --> 00:47:13.140
Honey!

00:47:13.460 --> 00:47:13.660
Honey!

00:47:14.020 --> 00:47:14.220
Honey!

00:47:14.720 --> 00:47:15.040
What?

00:47:15.400 --> 00:47:22.820
Ha-Ha-Ha-Ha!

00:47:33.730 --> 00:47:34.590
It's the real one!

00:47:35.480 --> 00:47:35.980
Let's go for it!

00:48:01.600 --> 00:48:04.080
It will be better to run away.

00:48:10.270 --> 00:48:16.260
Forgive me life, master, father, hero, please forgive me.

00:48:16.440 --> 00:48:18.480
My moustache, no, please.

00:48:19.740 --> 00:48:22.140
My moustache, no, please, no.

00:48:27.470 --> 00:48:29.190
My moustache, my moustache.

00:48:47.530 --> 00:48:51.070
We could not with him. It's okay, I'll wait for you, Goldenbat.

00:48:58.580 --> 00:48:59.780
Goldenbat, we can ask you...

00:49:00.000 --> 00:49:04.760
It is something very simple that will not cost you anything.

00:49:05.020 --> 00:49:10.180
He never dreamed of meeting you.

00:49:10.300 --> 00:49:11.900
Can you visit him sometime?

00:49:12.770 --> 00:49:14.290
So he will heal before.

00:49:14.830 --> 00:49:17.420
His only desire is to see you.

00:49:17.680 --> 00:49:20.910
I beg you, Golden Bat.

00:49:22.170 --> 00:49:23.690
I beg you, Golden Bat.

00:49:54.540 --> 00:49:59.540
I can't help you build the rocket

00:50:00.000 --> 00:50:02.920
TNM, so that you can use it against humanity.

00:50:06.420 --> 00:50:09.360
Bighead, if you don't collaborate, you won't come back to your house alive.

00:50:09.380 --> 00:50:09.980
You'll see.

00:50:23.320 --> 00:50:25.370
No, I can't take it anymore.

00:50:28.480 --> 00:50:28.920
Juni...

00:50:30.000 --> 00:50:31.200
A daughter of mine...

00:50:33.300 --> 00:50:37.630
Golden Bat, please, save my poor father from the clutches of Black Star!

00:50:38.140 --> 00:50:41.840
Golden Bat, please, we trust you. You are our hope.

00:50:42.180 --> 00:50:47.360
Please, save him from those evil ones! You are powerful and invincible and you will never die!

00:51:12.960 --> 00:51:19.750
Golden Bat, it's time for your funeral to begin. Ready the Robot X-1!

00:51:30.120 --> 00:51:30.850
Don't be afraid

00:52:14.620 --> 00:52:19.260
Goldenback is over. From now on, no one will interfere in my projects.

00:52:19.700 --> 00:52:20.380
No one!

00:52:23.120 --> 00:52:27.740
What's going on? How is this possible?

00:52:31.200 --> 00:52:41.220
I have waited anxiously to avenge myself. I'm not afraid of you. Let's kill each other in battle, Golden Bat.

00:52:41.420 --> 00:52:44.820
So I will have the pleasure of destroying you with my own hands.

00:54:30.800 --> 00:54:32.600
I'll take revenge on you, Golden Bat!

00:54:33.080 --> 00:54:33.920
I'll take revenge!

00:54:34.440 --> 00:54:36.460
We'll see each other again!

00:54:54.660 --> 00:54:55.780
Juni, Juni!

00:54:56.560 --> 00:54:58.640
You've had a really bad time, haven't you, Dad?

00:55:02.770 --> 00:55:07.450
You have had to suffer, being in the hands of those scoundrels, right honey?

00:55:08.360 --> 00:55:11.740
Mucho, dad, let's forget the bad times, let's be good.

00:55:12.420 --> 00:55:20.420
He has little left, I could only save him a miracle.

00:55:52.460 --> 00:55:54.460
from my other friends.

00:55:54.572 --> 00:55:56.572
You seem to be feeling better, eh?

00:55:56.572 --> 00:55:58.072
Yes, it's true.

00:55:58.668 --> 00:55:59.168
Yes!

00:55:59.244 --> 00:55:59.964
You have a lot of...

00:56:00.000 --> 00:56:01.560
It looks better than before.

00:56:02.430 --> 00:56:03.610
You don't have to lie.

00:56:04.290 --> 00:56:06.980
I'll die very soon, I know.

00:56:07.880 --> 00:56:08.640
Don't say nonsense.

00:56:09.180 --> 00:56:10.440
Are you really getting better?

00:56:10.840 --> 00:56:13.700
I would have liked to see Goldenbat before he died.

00:56:13.800 --> 00:56:16.780
I would have seen the most beautiful of my dreams.

00:56:17.690 --> 00:56:19.770
He will surely come to see you.

00:56:19.790 --> 00:56:20.910
He promised us.

00:56:21.210 --> 00:56:22.950
I ask you one last favor.

00:56:23.170 --> 00:56:26.250
Sing me the song of Goldenbat, please.

00:56:26.750 --> 00:56:28.860
Do it for me, Goldenbat.

00:56:31.630 --> 00:56:31.950
Thank you.

00:57:14.460 --> 00:57:23.460
I would like to be like you. Tell me how I will be a Golden Bat. I would be able to make any sacrifice.

00:57:24.060 --> 00:57:29.640
Listen, if you are fair and courageous, you can become a Golden Bat. Remember.

00:57:30.190 --> 00:57:32.470
In any circumstances, fair and valiant.

00:57:32.730 --> 00:57:34.440
Fair and valiant!

00:57:35.430 --> 00:57:38.370
You also have to have courage to fight against the disease, Honey.

00:57:38.730 --> 00:57:40.090
To be like Golden Bat.

00:57:40.680 --> 00:57:42.100
Now I have to go.

00:57:42.480 --> 00:57:46.680
Instead of saying goodbye, you could sing my song. I would like to.

00:57:47.000 --> 00:57:47.240
Yes!

00:57:48.070 --> 00:57:49.930
Be fair and valiant. Goodbye, boys.

00:58:00.000 --> 00:58:00.200
Thank you.
